  "Visualize long-term data such as annual variations in processes and parameters that can vary depending on days of the week or shifts, etc.": "可视化可以在很长一段时间内随数据而变化的参数，例如过程，一周中的天数，轮班等等。",
  "Visualize the correlation between a large number of variables with respect to target variable.": "可视化大量变量相对于目标变量之间的相关性。",
  "Visualize co-occurrence (relationships that focus on how often one phenomenon and another occur at the same time) of faults/alarms.": "可视化故障，警报，事件等的同时出现（重点是同时出现一种现象的频率）。",
  "Digital Native QC 7 Tools: 7 QC tools compatible with DX developed as tools to support QC activities suitable for the digital native era.": "空的Digital Native QC 7 Tools : デジタルネイティブ時代にふさわしいQC活動を支えるツールとして開発された、DXに対応したQC7つ道具。",
  "Analysis Platform : That makes it easy to data link, visualize, statistical analysis, and machine learning.": "Analysis Platform：用于数据映射，可视化，统计分析和机器学习的简单工具。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to be plotted on the graph. Select the process and item you want to plot on the graph.": "指定图的数据（例如数值变量：测量值）。选择要在图上绘制的过程和项目。最多可以选择20个项目。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to create data distributions. This data is plotted on the graph.": "指定图的数据（例如数值变量：测量值）。选择要在图上绘制的过程和项目。最多可以选择8个项目。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value and category variable like part number) to visualize pattern. This data is plotted on the graph. It can be selected up to ten items.": "空的可視化したいパターンを生成するデータ(量的変数：測定値など、カテゴリ変数 : 品番など)の項目です。このデータがグラフにプロットされます。最大18項目選択できます。",
  "Enter target item of data (quantitative variable like measurement value) to visualize the correlation between variables. This data is plotted on the graph. It can be selected up to four items.": "可视化变量之间相关性的数据项（定量变量：测量值等）。该数据绘制在图表上。可以选择2到7个参数。",
  "Enter target item of quantitative variable (like measurement value) in data to visualize the correlation between variables. This data is plotted on the graph.": "选择项目以可视化变量之间的相关性。最多可以选择60个项目。",
