  "Dummy Datetime Generate On DS Confirm Message": "The target file does not have a datetime column.\nThe system requires datetime, so are you sure to generate dummy datetime(DatetimeDummy) and continue setting?\n\nDummy datetime is generated as follows.\n* Generate initial datetime on the first record of the target file which is 00:00 on the 1st day of this month.\n* Recursively add 10 seconds by records.\n* For the next file, initialize by 00:00 on the next day of latest datetime, and recursively add 10 seconds by records.\n",
  "Dummy Datetime Generate On Proc Confirm Message": "Dummy datetime (DatetimeDummy) was generated because there is no datetime column in the target file.\n\nPlease check the generated dummy datetime and import it with \"As Datetime\" checked.\n\nDummy datetime is generated as follows.\n* Generate initial datetime on the first record of the target file which is 00:00 on the 1st day of this month.\n* Recursively add 10 seconds by records.\n* For the next file, initialize by 00:00 on the next day of latest datetime, and recursively add 10 seconds by records.\n",
