  "ImportLimitTitle": "Limits the number of rows to import.\nThe limit applies to each process (e.g., for a database: table, for CSV: folder).\nIf you decrease the limit or when importing the latest data, if the number of rows exceeds the limit,\nthe oldest data will be deleted from database in AP+DN7.\nWhen the import limit is increased, the data previously imported into AP+DN7 is first deleted and then re-imported from the data sources.",
